  "items": {
    "required": {
      "note": "Items from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tool_belt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tool belt</a> are not listed unless they do not work or are not automatically added.",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "req:20a68x",
          "html": "45 logs of any kind that you have the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Firemaking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firemaking</a> level to use, in 2 sets of 20 and 1 set of 5. The sets have to be of the same kind for the quest.",
          "text": "45 logs of any kind that you have the Firemaking level to use, in 2 sets of 20 and 1 set of 5. The sets have to be of the same kind for the quest.",
          "alternatives": [
            "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Regular logs</a> are enough for the quest, which can be cut from nearby <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">trees</a>.",
            "Some logs like <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Acadia_logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">acadia logs</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Corrupted_magic_logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">corrupted magic logs</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Eternal_magic_logs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">eternal magic logs</a> will not properly work.",
            "You may refer to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/All_Fired_Up_(minigame)#Lighting_the_beacons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">All Fired Up (minigame)#Lighting the beacons</a>."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "recommended": {
      "note": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rec:l5s34z",
          "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Invitation_box\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Invitation box</a> for quick transportation, if available.",
          "text": "Invitation box for quick transportation, if available.",
          "alternatives": [
            "Alternatively, the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Skeletal_horror_Teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Skeletal horror Teleport</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fort_Forinthry_lodestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fort Forinthry lodestone</a>, or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fort_Forinthry_Teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fort Forinthry Teleport</a> scrolls may be used."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rec:1liaix7",
          "html": "Bring the items above in the form of the first 20 logs, a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hatchets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hatchet</a> for cutting the other 20 logs from the normal trees between the beacons, and 5 logs of any type to relight the first <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Beacon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">beacon</a>, along with the required tinderbox.",
          "text": "Bring the items above in the form of the first 20 logs, a hatchet for cutting the other 20 logs from the normal trees between the beacons, and 5 logs of any type to relight the first beacon, along with the required tinderbox.",
          "alternatives": []
        },
        {
          "id": "rec:1nvf3l1",
          "html": "Equipping any tier of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Seer%27s_headband\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seer&#39;s headband</a> can speed this already short quest up considerably.",
          "text": "Equipping any tier of Seer's headband can speed this already short quest up considerably.",
          "alternatives": []
        },
        {
          "id": "rec:1gjeikm",
          "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Weight-reducing_clothing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Weight-reducing clothing</a> can help since carrying the logs will slow you down. Additionally, any tier of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Explorer%27s_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explorer&#39;s ring</a> can help recharge <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Energy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">run energy</a>.",
          "text": "Weight-reducing clothing can help since carrying the logs will slow you down. Additionally, any tier of Explorer's ring can help recharge run energy.",
          "alternatives": []
        },
        {
          "id": "rec:1ik7zzw",
          "html": "You can also use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Salt-water_spring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">salt-water spring</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Oo%27glog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Oo&#39;glog</a> or the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Anachronia_base_camp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anachronia base camp</a> for a temporary and unlimited run energy boost",
          "text": "You can also use the salt-water spring in Oo'glog or the Anachronia base camp for a temporary and unlimited run energy boost",
          "alternatives": [
            "Or, an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ogre_flask_(salt_water)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ogre flask (salt water)</a>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rec:nymwh7",
          "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock_Teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock Teleport</a> runes",
          "text": "Varrock Teleport runes",
          "alternatives": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
